  "body": "Beautifully presented and ready to enjoy, this stylishly designed home offers the kind of easy-care family living that makes settling in effortless. \r\n\r\nLight, bright and welcoming, the open-plan kitchen, dining and living spaces create a great setting for everyday living and entertaining, with seamless access to a private outdoor area that's ideal for relaxing or catching up with friends over summer.\r\n\r\n- Architecturally designed by renowned architects Avery Leuschke\r\n- Primarily cedar weatherboard cladding with some fibre cement \r\n- The home has been very well maintained and we have a thermal-imaging report available at the open home, adding peace of mind!\r\n- Light-filled open-plan living and dining\r\n- Private outdoor entertaining area\r\n- All bedrooms located on the upper level\r\n- Double internal-access garage plus additional off-street parking\r\n- Exceptional location, with sought-after schools walking distance - Kohimarama Primary School, Selwyn College, St Thomas' School and two popular daycares - Kohimarama Private Preschool and Kindercare Learning Centre\r\n- Walking distance to Madills Farm and close to all 3 bays - Kohimarama, Mission Bay and St Heliers beach, plus Kohi Beach Eatery\r\n- Eastridge is also less than a 5 minute drive and 15 minute walk\r\n- New CRL connection from Orakei, Meadowbank and Glen Innes just a short drive\r\n\r\nWith the beach, parks, shopping and everyday amenities all close at hand, this is a fantastic opportunity to secure a quality home in one of the Eastern Bays' most desirable neighbourhoods. Simply move in, make yourself at home and enjoy everything Kohimarama has to offer.\r\n\r\nAuction Tuesday 24th November 2026 at 2pm (unless sold prior)",
